  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-12-14T22:25:41.614Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "At the moment, we can effectively make an intro animation for avatars by setting it to play only once. Printer has done a lot of amazing intro animations where his character dissolves or loads in, in particular! It would be really cool to be able to have animations that play in their entirety when someone is switching to another avatar- this way if someone wanted to create a type of transition from one avatar to another, like disintegrating and reforming, or digging underground and the coming back up, it could be done. Definitely a small thing but something that would be really neat down the road!",
